      "writtenOn": "2023-12-12T12:31:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No its not a bug, previously we checked against two non-recoverable failure responses, if we got those we are exiting the script.\n\nNow checking, if not CRC failure exit the script. This logic has been changed to accommodate the new failure responses.",
